。批准状态不等于文件内容已经被读取，仍需留下实际工具结果。\n","type":"retrieval"},{"order":4,"paragraphIndex":0,"score":0,"selected":false,"source":"doc-04","text":"# 资料索引","type":"retrieval"},{"order":4,"paragraphIndex":2,"score":0,"selected":false,"source":"doc-04","text":"资料索引说明怎样从真实正文中定位段落。关键词只帮助选择资料，不携带事实答案。改变查询词可以使检索遗漏原本相关的片段，因此回答可能变成证据不足。","type":"retrieval"},{"order":4,"paragraphIndex":3,"score":0,"selected":false,"source":"doc-04","text":"背景说明：索引元数据与正文分离。实现不能把任务 ID 当成答案开关，也不能读取 expectedFacts 来替代检索。\n","type":"retrieval"},{"order":5,"paragraphIndex":0,"score":0,"selected":false,"source":"doc-05","text":"# 失败处理","type":"retrieval"},{"order":5,"paragraphIndex":1,"score":0,"selected":false,"source":"doc-05","text":"处理动作：停止并重新读取基线\n断连结果：记录 outcome_unknown\n重试条件：重新确认状态和预算\n缺失文件处理：返回读取错误","type":"retrieval"},{"order":5,"paragraphIndex":2,"score":0,"selected":false,"source":"doc-05","text":"失败处理资料把文件基线变化和恢复动作分开说明。断连后不能因为进程退出就猜测成功；只有重新确认状态和证据后才可决定重试。本资料没有生产吞吐量或发布命令事实。","type":"retrieval"},{"order":5,"paragraphIndex":3,"score":0,"selected":false,"source":"doc-05","text":"背景说明：错误响应、越界路径、缺失文件和无响应都应该成为可观察终态。离线回答器没有权限替错误补充事实。\n","type":"retrieval"},{"order":6,"paragraphIndex":0,"score":0,"selected":false,"source":"doc-06","text":"# 发布操作","type":"retrieval"}],"answer":{"rawAnswer":"传输方式：JSON Lines（来源：doc-01）\n协议版本：rein-extension/0.1（来源：doc-01）","claims":[{"field":"传输方式","value":"JSON Lines","source":"doc-01"},{"field":"协议版本","value":"rein-extension/0.1","source":"doc-01"}],"insufficientEvidence":false},"quality":1.0,"unsupportedClaims":[],"elapsedMs":297,"serviceTokens":null,"modelCalls":1,"callRecords":[{"task_id":"task-27038-3-1789471373080484000","request_id":"request-1","call_id":"call-1","prepared":true,"dispatched":true,"terminal":"succeeded","reason":"succeeded","child_pid":27268,"exit_code":0,"reaped":true},{"task_id":"task-27038-3-1789471373080484000","request_id":"request-2","call_id":"call-2","prepared":true,"dispatched":true,"terminal":"succeeded","reason":"succeeded","child_pid":27294,"e